{
  "name": "Synaptic Static",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You cause psychic energy to erupt at a point within range. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on that point makes an Intelligence saving throw, taking 8d6 Psychic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>On a failed save, a target also has muddled thoughts for 1 minute. During that time, it subtracts [[/r 1d6]] from all its attack rolls and ability checks, as well as any Constitution saving throws to maintain Concentration. The target makes an [[/save ability=int dc=@attributes.spell.dc format=long]] at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
